  nonce: bc12  # bc12
  message: "Fixed in PR #1398 (dev 1abb5625c2). compute_symbol_mention_centrality_batch now matches names with _NameMatcher (one tokenization + set intersection for identifier names; segment-pruned, per-name confirmation for compound names) instead of one names-wide alternation.\nBEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE, the item's repro re-run on dev 1abb5625c2 (2026-10-02 23:29, fresh XDG_CACHE_HOME, iowait 0): `survey` on flink (14.6k Java files) COMPLETES, rc=0, **650.6 s** wall (1.7 GB survey). Before: timeouts at 30 and 60 min (06-29), and in this session <100 of 1,775 centrality files in 32 min (projected >= 9.5 h).\nCentrality scan: 1,775 files, 18.6 MB, 106,319 eligible names in **5.8 s**. Other phases: analyzers 255 s, linkers 107 s, _classify_symbols 16.1 s (was 319 s; WI-fojot), detect_profile 3.8 s.\nEquivalence: on 5 real flink docs with 50,637 real flink names, matched sets identical to the old regex. Deliberate documented change: names match independently (the alternation consumed text). smart-test 3977 passed, changed sources at 100% coverage."  # bc12
